<title>SINGAPORE: HeShe full year net loss S$12.37 mln.</title>
<headline>HeShe full year net loss S$12.37 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				12.37 vs  13.26</p>
<p>    Loss per share (cts)		 4.35 vs   4.79</p>
<p>    Fully dil. loss per share (cts)  3.77 vs   4.19</p>
<p>    Turnover			     194.94 vs 199.28</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	2.01 vs   0.05</p>
<p>    Interest expense		     4.36 vs   3.17</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortization	  7.48 vs   6.74</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss			   9.58 vs  10.78</p>
<p>    Tax					1.54 vs   1.55</p>
<p>    Minorities (gain)		    1.25 vs   0.81</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries (gain)	     0.42 vs  11.45</p>
<p>Note - Retailer and garment manufacturer HeShe Holdings Ltd said its turnover fell slightly due to the downsizing of its Singapore retailing and manufacturing operations. It said it suffered extraordinary charges due to the closures of Singapore $3.1 million.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
